  "claim": "The executive producer of Small Town Gay Bar co-founded View Askew Productions and produced numerous movies starring a principle actor in \"Kissing A Fool\". Small Town Gay Bar was a 2006 documentary film.",
  "evidencia": "Page: Jason Lee (actor). Sentence: He is also known for his roles in Kevin Smith films such as \"Mallrats\", \"Chasing Amy\", \"Dogma\", \"Jay and Silent Bob Strike Back\", \"Jersey Girl\", \"Clerks II\" and \"Cop Out\".\nPage: Kevin Smith. Sentence: While not strictly sequential, the films frequently featured crossover plot elements, character references, and a shared canon described by fans as the \"View Askewniverse\", named after his production company View Askew Productions, which he co-founded with Scott Mosier.\nPage: Kissing a Fool. Sentence: It primarily stars David Schwimmer, Jason Lee, Mili Avital, Kari Wührer and Vanessa Angel.\nPage: Small Town Gay Bar. Sentence: The documentary was produced by View Askew Productions with Kevin Smith serving as executive producer.",
